In some way humans are parasitic organisms growing on the earth so they'd
need x3 too.

zo'onai they do depend on e.g. oxygen. why isn't there any such place for
humans? Such distinction would be useful since many organisms live and can
only live without atmospheric O2.

I'm also not sure if commensalism can always be distinguished from
parasitism.



